World --> Facility
World --> BaseKind

' Zeit und Reisen
LogEntry <|-- Journey
Journey "*" --> "0..1" Ship : ship
Booking "*" --> "0..1" Journey : won
LogEntry <|-$newArrow("2026-11-20d")- SystemJourney
SystemJourney "*" -$newArrow("2026-11-20d")-> "1" World : from
SystemJourney "*" -$newArrow("2026-11-20d")-> "1" World : to
SystemJourney "*" -$newArrow("2026-11-20d")-> "*" Character : travellers
SystemJourney "*" -$newArrow("2026-11-20d")-> "0..1" Ship : ship
Booking "*" -$newArrow("2026-11-20d")-> "0..1" SystemJourney : ticketFor

' Charaktererschaffung und Lebenslauf
Character "*" --> "0..1" World : homeworld
Character --> NpcRole

' Laufbahnen (Referenzdaten)

' Subsektor und Welten
World "1" *-- "1" Uwp : uwp
World "*" --> "*" TradeCode : /trade
World "*" --> "0..1" Temperature : temperature
World "1" *-- "0..1" Surface : surface

' Charakter
Character "1" *-- "1" Upp : upp
Character "1" *-- "*" SkillLevel : skills

' Waffen (Referenzdaten)
World "*" --> "*" Item : /offer

' Verlauf
LogEntry <|-- DiceRoll
LogEntry <|-- TaskResult
LogEntry <|-- Note
Note "*" --> "0..1" LogEntry : interprets
TaskResult "*" --> "1" Character : for

' Probe

' Angriff

' Begegnung
Character "*" --> "0..1" Item : wears

' Karte


